  CTE.json    Python Level 1 with CodeBot (CodeBot): its first six missions
  PWR.json    Coding with Robots (CodeBot): its first six missions
  LCX.json    Python with CodeX (CodeX): its first six missions
  FLY.json    Fly with Python (CodeAIR): its first six missions

Each pack also says so in its own "licence" field, which BitsWorkbench shows on the pack's page.

